{"3919280": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "2 in 1 Experience Hidden Objects", "steam_appid": 3919280, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to a fascinating hidden object journey through the mystical world of history and nature! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover ancient artifacts, explore the mysterious temples of Egypt, roam through the dense, green jungle full of exotic animals and hidden treasures, and explore ancient Rome with its magnificent buildings. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Behind the various levels to be unlocked are fascinating hidden object pictures and puzzle games on topics such as: museum, Egypt, Asia, the jungle, and ancient Rome.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can also find objects by sound, develop your detective skills in a study, search for constellations, or paint pictures by numbers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Search for hidden objects, discover exciting details and puzzles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Have fun searching, discovering and marveling on this exciting hidden object journey! </p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to a fascinating hidden object journey through the mystical world of history and nature! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover ancient artifacts, explore the mysterious temples of Egypt, roam through the dense, green jungle full of exotic animals and hidden treasures, and explore ancient Rome with its magnificent buildings. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Behind the various levels to be unlocked are fascinating hidden object pictures and puzzle games on topics such as: museum, Egypt, Asia, the jungle, and ancient Rome.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class